[{"client_msg_id":"1b277bd7-318c-4264-b0e8-af4d9d2e02af","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"以下のようなメッセージが出ます\n`coc.nvim]: Error on \"runCommand\": Unexpected line format: ^[[33m[bat warning]^[[0m: Unknown theme 'ansi', using default.`","ts":"1626058773.225000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hDsn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b0c845d7-4621-444d-bcd6-8ebb808471ff","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あれ、なんか変なところあるんでしたっけ・・・\nちょっとあとでみます","ts":"1626058673.224700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QAHTu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cd8acf84-0c89-4889-8007-81be9e4b40c2","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"\u003c@U8996GYBF\u003e\n`Fix applied bat theme` の修正ってcoc版は未対応でしょうか。\n手動で `let g:fzf_preview_lines_command = 'bat --color=always --plain --number` すれば使えるので問題はないのですが一応で。","ts":"1626055646.224300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UVp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e212681c-1498-46e3-be35-2e0b48a26953","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"そういえば一ヶ月弱ぐらい前から coc がLSP 3.16の機能（セマンティックトークンとか）に対応したみたいですね。","ts":"1626055522.222900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o1/Aj"}]}]
